sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Trader
    participant S as Server · OrderManager
    participant B as Broker
    T->>S: modify (qty / price / trigger)
    S->>S: working? broker id known? no cancel on its way?<br/>new qty above the filled? rules · gate (modify)
    alt refused
        S-->>T: OrderError in words (e.g. "nothing to change")
    else sent
        S->>B: modify
        B-->>S: ok → MODIFY_SENT (the new values shown)
        Note over S,B: no clear answer → "check the order before retrying"
    end
    T->>S: cancel
    S->>S: already asked? (a second click changes nothing)<br/>gate (cancels pass even when trading is stopped)
    alt broker id not known yet
        S->>S: pending = CANCEL, sent as soon as the id arrives
    else
        S->>B: cancel
    end
    B-->>S: update CANCELLED (filled part kept)
    S-->>T: order CANCELLED
